WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:01.720
Please, Commander Liu

00:01.800 --> 00:02.920
Order the volunteers

00:03.000 --> 00:05.200
To prepare an assault on the Wuzhao camp

00:05.280 --> 00:06.440
Those unwilling to fight

00:06.520 --> 00:07.760
Are spies

00:07.840 --> 00:09.640
Isn't this a bit arbitrary?

00:12.640 --> 00:14.320
If they don't dare fight the Wuzhao

00:14.400 --> 00:15.320
Then these people

00:15.400 --> 00:18.067
Why would they want to enter the city?

00:19.760 --> 00:21.160
I understand

00:29.000 --> 00:30.400
What do you mean?

00:30.640 --> 00:32.160
First you won't let us in

00:32.240 --> 00:33.640
Now you want us to be the vanguard

00:33.720 --> 00:34.760
To die

00:34.840 --> 00:35.320
Damn it

00:35.440 --> 00:37.107
I won't take this insult

00:37.920 --> 00:39.160
We brothers rushed here

00:39.240 --> 00:41.040
To fight the Wuzhao

00:41.280 --> 00:41.960
Old Liu

00:42.040 --> 00:43.600
Don't try to smooth things over

00:43.680 --> 00:45.080
Those bastards in Yiyang

00:45.160 --> 00:46.560
I'm done serving them

00:46.720 --> 00:47.280
Let's go

00:47.360 --> 00:47.680
Go

00:47.840 --> 00:49.240
You

00:49.760 --> 00:51.160
Go

00:55.400 --> 00:56.800
Your Highness

00:57.960 --> 00:59.240
Those unwilling to fight

00:59.320 --> 01:01.320
Have all left with their men

01:02.320 --> 01:03.720
The remaining

01:03.800 --> 01:05.200
Follow me into the city

01:05.280 --> 01:06.520
Yes
